---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base search={false} crumbs={[['Legal','/legal/'],['Privacy','/legal/privacy/']]} title="Privacy" description="aditejus.com sets no cookies and uses no trackers. Here is exactly what is and is not stored.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="ph"><h1>Privacy</h1><p class="faint">Last updated: 31 October 2026 (draft for creator approval)</p></header>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>The short version</h2>
      <p>This site sets no cookies, runs no analytics or advertising trackers and loads no third-party scripts. Fonts are served from this site, not from a font service.</p>
      <h2>What stays in your browser</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Theme choice</strong> (light or dark), if you switch it.</li>
        <li><strong>Roadmap progress</strong>: the steps you tick on the Roadmaps page.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Both are saved in your browser's local storage on your device only. We never receive them. Clear them any time with “Clear my progress” on the Roadmaps page or by clearing site data in your browser.</p>
      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub may log technical data such as IP addresses to keep the service secure; see GitHub's privacy statement. We do not get access to individual visitor data.</p>
      <h2>Newsletter</h2>
      <p>The sign-up form is not connected yet and sends nothing. Before it goes live, this page will name the email provider and explain how your address is stored and how to unsubscribe.</p>
      <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
      <p>Links to YouTube, Udemy, GitHub and Discord take you to those services, which have their own privacy policies. Videos are linked, not embedded, so nothing from YouTube loads on this site.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p class="todo">TODO (creator): contact email for privacy questions.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
